MALTEGO:

1. Open Maltego.
2. Login to Community account.
3. Click New Graph.
4. From left palette, drag Domain onto graph.
5. Double-click Domain.
6. Enter: kccollege.edu.in
7. Right-click Domain.
8. Select Run Transform.
9. Select:
   Search Web > To Email (domain)
10. Again right-click Domain.
11. Select:
   Search Web > To Phone Numbers
12. Right-click discovered email.
13. Select Search Web transform if available.
14. Observe connected entities in graph.
15. Take screenshot of graph.

NOTE:
- Transforms may require login or credits.
- If a transform is unavailable, show the domain entity and available results.
